+	/**
+	 * Blizzard launcher: loads, while the map loads, the models and textures of every kind of unit the units on the
+	 * map can make or build (the buildings a worker builds, the units a building trains, what it upgrades to, and so
+	 * on down the tree). Each was loaded when the first one of its kind was made, in the middle of play: a frame of a
